<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-5ad01b89-7fff-3bdb-526b-b32db0e3ccbc" style="">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span><div><span style=""><br></span></div><div><span style="">This is a reminder that the Mexico Insurance policy below is about to expire.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><div dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;" align="left"><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse;"><colgroup><col width="33"><col width="558"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height:16.5pt"><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p></td></tr><tr style="height:185.98681640625pt"><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;padding:15pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Policy Renewal Details</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Current Policy: <i>{!Policy__c.Name} </i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>Current Policy Underwriter:  </i></span><font color="#333333" face="Arial"><span style="font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Underwriter_picklist__c}</i></span></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Expiration: <i>{!Policy__c.End_Date__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Policy Summary: </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><font color="#333333" face="Arial"><span style="font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Territory_picklist__c}</i></span></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Year__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Make__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Model__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Value__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Liability_picklist__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i>{!Policy__c.Medical_picklist__c}</i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><i><br></i></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7142857142857142;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><b style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-fami